      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "## Setup checklist\n1. Replace YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID in all 6 Google Sheets nodes (or reselect via From List). Sheet tab named 'Leads' with header row:\nlead_id, timestamp, full_name, company, email, phone, website, business_type, team_size, monthly_revenue, challenge, goal, raw_answers, status, score, score_reason, summary, draft_reply, final_reply, sent_at, last_error\n2. Replace REVIEWER_EMAIL@getshtdonehq.com (2 approval nodes) and YOUR_ALERT_EMAIL@getshtdonehq.com (2 alert nodes)\n3. In 'AI System Prompt' node: replace BOOKING_LINK and confirm the offer description matches what GSD HQ sells\n4. Attach credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, Gmail OAuth2, Anthropic API\n5. Self-hosted: set WEBHOOK_URL env var so approval-form links in emails resolve\n6. In prequalification.html set WEBHOOK_URL to this workflow's production URL (…/webhook/client-qualification)"
      }
